SUMMARY:Bingo Night
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a fun night of Bingo at Hillsboro Downtown Station! 🎉 Bingo is free to play and open to all ages! We’ll play 5 exciting rounds— the first 4 rounds feature fun prizes from Hillsboro Downtown Station (check our Insta the day before to see the prize theme!). The final round is our Community Round\, where prizes are brought in by the community\, making it a surprise every time. Bring the family\, grab some food from our 25+ food carts\, and join the fun! 🎲🏆 \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/bingo-night-2/2026-05-06/
LOCATION:Hillsboro Downtown Station\, 320 SE Baseline St\, Hillsboro\, O\, 97123\, United States
CATEGORIES:Family Fun,Gaming,Kids Calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/Red-Modern-Bingo-Night-Instagram-Post.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Hillsboro downtown Station":MAILTO:manager@hillsborodowntownstation.com
END:VEVENT
